WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.610
«We already have the tools in the back office.»

2
00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:05.370
You're right. You have the tools.

3
00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.080
Every company has them, and always has.

4
00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.500
And your contact list is still stuck.

5
00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:13.340
Because a tool waits for you to open it.

6
00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:16.080
And it tells you what to say to a type of person.

7
00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:18.240
RelAI doesn't wait.

8
00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:20.100
At 8 it comes looking for you.

9
00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:22.480
And it doesn't write to a type of person.

10
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:26.230
It writes to Marco, starting from what Marco told you.

11
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:28.430
Your tools don't get thrown away.

12
00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:33.370
The video, the presentation, the event link: you put them in the Closing section.

13
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:38.180
And RelAI uses them with the right person, at the right time.

14
00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:40.320
You have the tools.

15
00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:43.030
What you're missing is someone who makes you use them.
